{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Share an mdoc with a reader nearby over Bluetooth, or be the reader,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with ISO\/IEC 18013-5 device retrieval."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In person, the holder shows a QR code and the reader scans it: the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"code carries the holder’s ephemeral key and how to reach it over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Bluetooth LE. The two devices then exchange encrypted messages over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GATT. The package carries the Bluetooth side itself: your app shows or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scans the QR code, follows the session’s states, and asks the holder."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Engagement is by QR code only. NFC engagement (a tap instead of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"code) is in OID4VCgo’s Kotlin library, not this package: an iOS holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can’t answer a reader’s tap, and an iOS reader can’t tap a holder. An"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Android reader or holder that offers both still works with this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"package over the QR code."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both sides need "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" in the app’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Info.plist. Keep the app in the foreground during a session: neither"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"side keeps one going while the app is suspended. A session answers one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request. Bluetooth failures are "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityError","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"s; protocol failures"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"s."}]},{"anchor":"Share-as-the-holder","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Share as the holder"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startProximityPresentation(timeouts:modes:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" returns a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation"},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/qrCode"},{"type":"text","text":" you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"show. It offers both "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityBLEMode"},{"type":"text","text":"s by default: it advertises"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the reader and scans for it at once, until a reader connects"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either way (a reader offered both should connect in central client"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mode). Pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"modes"},{"type":"text","text":" to offer one. It then reports"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/State-swift.enum\/requestReceived(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" with who is asking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and what: ask the holder, then respond or decline."}]},{"code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ What the holder agreed to share: a requested document, the held","\/\/\/ mdoc to answer it with, and the elements to disclose.","struct InPersonAnswer {","    let document: Int","    let credentialID: String","    let elements: [MdocPresentation.Element]","}","","\/\/\/ Shares an mdoc in person. `showQRCode` displays the code; `consent`","\/\/\/ shows the reader's request and returns the holder's answer, or nil","\/\/\/ to decline. Returns whether the copy shared had been seen by another","\/\/\/ Verifier, or nil when nothing was shared.","func shareInPerson(wallet: Wallet, showQRCode: (String) -> Void,","                   consent: (ProximityPresentation.Request) async -> InPersonAnswer?) async throws -> Bool? {","    let session = try wallet.startProximityPresentation()","    showQRCode(session.qrCode)","    for await state in session.states {","        switch state {","        case .requestReceived(let request):","            guard let answer = await consent(request) else {","                await session.decline()","                return nil","            }","            \/\/ The holder key signs now: Face ID, if the key store asks.","            return try await session.respond(document: answer.document, credentialID: answer.credentialID,","                                             elements: answer.elements)","        case .failed(let error):","            throw error","        case let state where state.isFinal:","            return nil","        default:","            continue","        }","    }","    return nil","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Show "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/Request\/reader"},{"type":"text","text":" on the consent screen. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader that signs its request (reader authentication) is named, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderIdentity\/Status-swift.enum\/trusted"},{"type":"text","text":" when its certificate chains"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots"},{"type":"text","text":". An unsigned request could"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"come from anyone who scanned the code. As over the Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader"},{"type":"text","text":" ends a session"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from any other reader before the holder sees it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/cancel()"},{"type":"text","text":" ends a session at any point, as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder leaves the screen, say. "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityTimeouts"},{"type":"text","text":" sets how long it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"waits: by default 60 seconds for a reader to connect, 30 for its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request, and 300 for the holder to decide."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Read as the verifier","anchor":"Read-as-the-verifier","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReader"},{"type":"text","text":" needs no "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":": give it the IACAs whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mdocs it accepts, and, to sign its requests so holders see who is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asking, a key in a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":" and its certificate chain, with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader authentication extended key usage"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderConfiguration","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"). The reader is a production one: it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses ("},{"code":"invalidInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") a configuration that leaves a decision open:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which IACAs issue which document types ("},{"code":"anyIssuerForAnyType","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"issuerRootsByDocType","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), and each role’s revocation ("},{"code":"revocation","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"crls","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"code":"noRevocationCheck","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to decline). "},{"code":"development","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" relaxes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this, for trying out a development issuer’s documents; never ship an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app with it set. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReader\/start(qrCode:docType:elements:timeouts:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes the holder’s QR code and what to ask for."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Reads an mDL's name and portrait from the holder whose QR code was","\/\/\/ scanned. Returns the verified mdoc, or nil if the holder declined or","\/\/\/ the mdoc isn't known to be unrevoked.","func readInPerson(qrCode: String, issuerRoots: String, crls: String) async throws -> VerifiedMdoc? {","    let reader = try ProximityReader(configuration: ProximityReaderConfiguration(","        issuerRoots: issuerRoots, crls: crls, revocation: [.issuer, .status],","        anyIssuerForAnyType: true))","    let session = try reader.start(qrCode: qrCode, docType: \"org.iso.18013.5.1.mDL\",","                                   elements: [\"org.iso.18013.5.1\": [\"given_name\", \"family_name\", \"portrait\"]])","    for await state in session.states {","        switch state {","        case .verified(let mdoc):","            let status = try await session.checkStatus()","            return status == .valid || status == .noStatus ? mdoc : nil","        case .failed(let error):","            throw error","        case let state where state.isFinal:","            return nil","        default:","            continue","        }","    }","    return nil","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc"},{"text":" carries the disclosed elements, the document signer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and the IACA it chains to, and its validity. Decide which issuers to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accept on ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/issuerChain"},{"text":", the verified certificate path:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/issuer"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/trustAnchor"},{"text":" are names any","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"document signer under a trusted IACA can choose, for display.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The session doesn’t check revocation itself:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderSession\/checkStatus()","type":"reference"},{"text":" does, once the session is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":".verified","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". It fetches the issuer’s status list over the network, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the reader needs a connection then, and verifies the list is signed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"under the certificate the document names or the CA that signed the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"document signer (ISO\/IEC 18013-5 §12.3.6). Rely on the document only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when it’s ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocStatus\/valid","type":"reference"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocStatus\/noStatus","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"role":"article","title":"Presenting in person","roleHeading":"Article"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Presenting in person","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderIdentity","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityTimeouts","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityError"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Presenting-in-person"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentinginperson"]}],"sections":[],"kind":"article","references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/VerifiedMdoc/issuerChain":{"abstract":[{"text":"The document signer’s verified certificate path, leaf first,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ending at the IACA in ","type":"text"},{"code":"ProximityReaderConfiguration.issuerRoots","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it chains to: decide which issuers to accept on it.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/issuerChain","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/verifiedmdoc\/issuerchain","title":"issuerChain","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"issuerChain","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@SecCertificateRef","text":"SecCertificate","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/mdocReaderRoots":{"abstract":[{"text":"PEM certificates: the mdoc readers recognized when one signs an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"org-iso-mdoc","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" request (","type":"text"},{"code":"MdocPresentation.Request.reader","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). Empty:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every such request is shown by its origin.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/mdocreaderroots","title":"mdocReaderRoots","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"mdocReaderRoots"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityTimeouts":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How long an in-person session waits (ISO\/IEC 18013-5 recommends at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"least 30 seconds from engagement to the request, §8.2.3, and 300"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"seconds of inactivity before ending a session, §9.1.1.4)."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityTimeouts","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ProximityTimeouts"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximitytimeouts","title":"ProximityTimeouts","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ProximityTimeouts"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityError":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An in-person session failed over Bluetooth, rather than in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"protocol ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WalletError"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityError","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ProximityError","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximityerror","title":"ProximityError","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ProximityError","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityReaderSession/checkStatus()":{"abstract":[{"text":"Checks the revocation status of the mdoc the session verified:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fetches the Token Status List its MSO names, over https from a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"public address, and verifies it’s signed under the certificate the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"MSO names or else under the CA that signed the document signer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(ISO\/IEC 18013-5 §12.3.6). Rely on the document only when this is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".valid"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".noStatus"},{"text":". Call it once the session is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".verified"},{"text":", after","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the Bluetooth connection has closed; before, it throws ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WalletError"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".wrongStep"},{"text":". A failed fetch is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".network"},{"text":", a list that doesn’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"verify ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".protocol"},{"text":"; cancelling the calling Task cancels it. The list","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"covers many documents, so fetching it doesn’t tell its publisher","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which one was presented.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderSession\/checkStatus()","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximityreadersession\/checkstatus()","title":"checkStatus()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"checkStatus"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet10MdocStatusO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MdocStatus"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeyStore":{"title":"KeyStore","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keystore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet’s keys: P-256 keys whose private halves never leave the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"store (the Secure Enclave). "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":" is the standard one."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A thrown error reaches Go and comes back as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".platform"},{"type":"text","text":" WalletError."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityReaderIdentity/Status-swift.enum/trusted":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Signed by a certificate that chains to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WalletConfiguration.mdocReaderRoots"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderIdentity\/Status-swift.enum\/trusted","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximityreaderidentity\/status-swift.enum\/trusted","title":"ProximityReaderIdentity.Status.trusted","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"trusted","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A holder’s wallet: OID4VCgo’s walletflow over the app’s key store,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential store and Wallet Provider."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Wallet","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet","title":"Wallet","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Wallet","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/startProximityPresentation(timeouts:modes:)":{"title":"startProximityPresentation(timeouts:modes:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Starts an ISO\/IEC 18013-5 in-person presentation over BLE: show"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"qrCode"},{"type":"text","text":". In "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"modes"},{"type":"text","text":", both by default, it advertises for a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader (peripheral server mode) and scans for one (central client"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mode) until a reader connects either way; a reader offered both"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"should choose central client mode. Bluetooth failures end it as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".failed"},{"type":"text","text":" with a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Pro